OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies choosing between food or
OL,4,Afurniture, says charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies facing furniture poverty were
OL,7,Fhaving to choose "between the food shop
OL,8,Fand the items that they need for their
OL,9,Fhome", a charity director has said.
OL,11,FJo Revett, the director of Dora Brown -
OL,12,Fwhich helps families in crisis in
OL,13,FWoodbridge, Ipswich and Felixstowe -
OL,14,Fwas speaking after Adrian Ramsay, the
OL,15,FMP for Waveney Valley, called on the
OL,16,Fgovernment to put together a strategy
OL,17,Fto end furniture poverty.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
