OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies choosing between food or
OL,4,Afurniture, says charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government spokesperson said: "Our
OL,7,F#1bn Crisis and Resilience Fund
OL,8,Fprovides a safety net for low-income
OL,9,Fhouseholds who are in crisis and in
OL,10,Fneed of immediate support, and can be
OL,11,Fused to provide essential furniture and
OL,12,Fappliances."
OL,14,FSo what is furniture poverty, how
OL,15,Fwidespread is it and what kind of
OL,16,Fproblems are families or individuals
OL,17,Fexperiencing?
